        "specs/trust-task-discovery/0.4/payload.schema.json (response schema)",
        "docs/04 section 11.2 (the list is the declared supportedTypes)",
        "specs/trust-task-discovery/0.3/spec.md:77-79 (same text in 0.3)",
        "specs/trust-task-discovery/0.4/spec.md:162 (a responder SHOULD answer in the version it was asked; a discoverer SHOULD ask 0.4 and MAY fall back to 0.3)",
